# CodeRabbit fixes stay local

When the work is fixing CodeRabbit comments, do not push the branch.

Make the changes and stop. Leave them unpushed so the user can read the diff. A CodeRabbit review, a red check, or "fix the comments" is not permission to push, force-push, or open a pull request.

Push only after the user explicitly says to push in that conversation, once they have seen what changed.
